  "modal.text": "Mai pipul dem wey kɔm vizit, wɛlkɔm! Ɛvri skin fɔ dis galari na di rizɔlt ɔf plɛnti awa ɔf wɔk. Skin wey di wɛbsait ona kriyet get kɔpirait protɛkshɔn: pipul fit vyu am, bɔt fɔ daunlod, kɔpi, an yuz am fɔ biznɛs, dem nid mek agrimɛnt fɛst. Ɔda matirial laik kep, blɔk an plant tɛkschɔ bilɔng to di pipul wey kriyet dem, wey dem mɛnshɔn fɔ di kapshɔn, an dem dey yuz dem akɔdin to dia laisɛns kɔndishɔn. Tank una fɔ ɔndastandin an ɔnɛsti! Mek una rimɛmba sey dis na unɔfishal Mainkraft savis. Mojang an Maikrosɔft no apruv am, an e no get kɔnɛkshɔn wit dem. Na di wɛbsait ona dem dey rɛspɔnsibul fɔ di sait, no bi Mojang an Maikrosɔft.",
